From 738ce3b3020b3950c48ce3122a08f32af531d4fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] aji: add negotiated snapshots and acknowledged lifecycle controls

The dispatcher exports protocol/schema v2; each backend reports its own
configuration, measured engine/model SHA-256 values, provider/device facts and real ticket state.
Drain/suspend use bounded completion-ticket waits and suspension releases the
configured chain before resume reloads only available prepared artifacts.

